  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/underground-village,-stoneholm/version/cg6QT9XM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/KmyhssPl?color=34D058&amp;label=Modrinth Downloads&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underground-villages-stoneholm/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1123746?color=FC7303&amp;label=CurseForge Downloads&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/underground_village-neo-forge?color=6E40C9&amp;label=Issues&amp;logo=github\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/CN962KMpJk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/430776550443581450?color=5865F2&amp;label=Online Users&amp;logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1123746/description_88a3d82d-4ba5-4d0b-8666-efc74536ed10.png\"></a></strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感谢我们的赞助商</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感谢 ZAP-HOSTING！使用优惠码 Reggarf-1047 可享订单 8 折优惠（立减 20%）！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1123746/description_18e17554-3893-489e-b435-8febf11b584c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<h2>简介</h2>\n<p>本模组是对旧版模组的重制版本 - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneholm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneholm</a>，适用于 Minecraft 1.20.1 至 1.21.1。</p>\n<section>\n<p>通过添加错综复杂的地下大厅与楼层，<strong>Stoneholm</strong> 为世界注入了全新类型的村庄。</p>\n<p>探索迷宫般的走廊，将其改造为你的私人住宅；或者在上方建造你的基地，将村民永远困于地下；又或者只是单纯地“邀请”村民加入你，用于一些并非邪恶的目的。<br><br></p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"506\"><strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"184\">发现脚下隐藏的奇妙世界！</strong><br data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"187\"><em data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"221\">地下村庄 – Stoneholm</em> 为你的 Minecraft 世界添加了程序生成的地下村落，它们建在地表之下广阔的地下洞穴中。这些地下聚落提供了崭新且沉浸式的生存体验，非常适合渴望探索与建筑奇迹的玩家。</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"759\">这些地下城镇的村民开凿出了错综复杂的大厅、住宅、农田和集会场所，并配备了照明与装饰，为深邃的地底带来了生机。这是寻找庇护所、进行交易，甚至以全新方式建立你基地的绝佳途径。</p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"786\">🔧 完全可配置</h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"895\">根据你的世界自定义体验！本模组支持完整配置，允许你：</p>\n<ul data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"983\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"983\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"921\">调整村庄规模</strong>，打造温馨的小聚落或庞大的地下都市。</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1098\">\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1098\"><strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1041\">设置距中心点的最大生成距离</strong>，控制地下村庄的生成位置与范围。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1258\">无论你是正在制作冒险地图、调整生存世界，还是仅仅想要更沉浸的村民体验，<em data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1234\">Stoneholm</em> 都能让你完全掌控一切。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923212424417361/pBsb5j2.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=a9de1f687e484d810385cff4061b8816fea7b9b9c21b5e173a3066dad3955a5a&amp;\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923211744808970/pw8F7p0.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=3cca3f02110888aee721ef3aa8a195df1eb275d014ac696f4ad29c6c85204cdf&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923211086434404/321lqSj.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=5885117d6e7b747e7c332a0f8020b85f0cb5766e1589b5d1614ce58dad9297c2&amp;\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1060956743821185074/1296923210570268732/5Jj3fDJ.jpg?ex=6714b61d&amp;is=6713649d&amp;hm=4756b0c8864bdc98b437d67733205dc6e9883133f1c5439905c485826a941ef2&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1377\"></h3>\n</blockquote>\n</section>",
